#. 諸君ッ！　調査お疲れ様だったな！！
#. どうだった？　新しい発見はあったか！？
msgctxt "0001 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"Okay, ladies and gentlemen! How'd it go? Did anyone\n"
"discover any interesting new anything!?"
msgstr ""

#. 図書室がありましたぞぉッ！
msgctxt "0002 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "There's a library!"
msgstr ""

#. プールがあったよ、プール！
#. トレーニング機器が充実した更衣室もッ！！
msgctxt "0003 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"And a pool! A freakin' pool! And locker rooms filled\n"
"with exercise equipment!"
msgstr ""

#. だが結局、出入口らしきものはなかったな…
msgctxt "0004 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"There was not, however, anything resembling an escape\n"
"route."
msgstr ""

#. そう…だね……
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Yeah...she's right..."
msgstr ""

#. しょげ返る事はない。僕の大発見を聞きたまえ…
msgctxt "0006 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"Well hey, there's no reason to get all sulky! Wait\n"
"till you hear about my amazing discovery!"
msgstr ""

#. なんと、この寄宿舎の１階にある、
#. <CLT 3>倉庫<CLT>と<CLT 3>大浴場<CLT>に入れるようになっていたのだッ！！
msgctxt "0007 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"The <CLT 3>warehouse<CLT> and <CLT 3>bathhouse<CLT> on the 1st floor of\n"
"the dorms are now open!"
msgstr ""

#. しかも、倉庫には食料や衣料などの生活必需品が
#. 大量に保管されてあった！　頭悪いほど大量にだぞ！
msgctxt "0008 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"And the warehouse is chock-full of food, clothes,\n"
"whatever you want. There's so much it's insane!"
msgstr ""

#. これで、いつでも小腹を満たせるという訳だな！
#. ハッハッハ…！
msgctxt "0009 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"So go ahead and stuff yourself to the gills whenever\n"
"you feel like! Ha-ha-ha!"
msgstr ""

#. ですが、<CLT 3>夜時間は出歩き禁止<CLT>です。
#. それをお忘れなく…
msgctxt "0010 | CELES"
msgid ""
"Keep in mind, of course, that <CLT 3>going out at nighttime\n"
"is still prohibited<CLT>. Please do not forget..."
msgstr ""

#. で…肝心の出口はどうだったんだ？
msgctxt "0011 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid ""
"Okay, and what about a fuckin' way out of here? You\n"
"find anything like that?"
msgstr ""

#. それは…えーっとだな……
msgctxt "0012 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "Oh, well...umm..."
msgstr ""

#. その倉庫には、
#. 脱出に使えそうなモンはなかったのか？
msgctxt "0013 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid ""
"There wasn't anything in the warehouse we could use to\n"
"get our asses outta here? Nothin'?"
msgstr ""

#. い、いや…残念ながら……
msgctxt "0014 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "U-Unfortunately, no...not that I saw..."
msgstr ""

#. …ったく、オメェラよぉ…
msgctxt "0015 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "You fuckin' people..."
msgstr ""

#. 新しい場所に行けるようになったとか、
#. はしゃいでる場合じゃねーだろ…
msgctxt "0016 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid ""
"Who gives a shit if we have a goddamn pool now!? Or a\n"
"warehouse, or whatever the fuck!"
msgstr ""

#. オレらは閉じ込められてんだぞッ！！
#. 出口を探せっつーんだよ、出口をッ！！
msgctxt "0017 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid ""
"We're still trapped in this piece of shit school! We\n"
"need to find a goddamn way OUT!"
msgstr ""

#. まぁまぁ、
#. そう目くじら立てても仕方ありませんわ。
msgctxt "0018 | CELES"
msgid ""
"Now, now. There is no point in taking your anger out\n"
"on us."
msgstr ""

#. 適応ですわよ適応…
#. 楽しく閉じ込められましょう。
msgctxt "0019 | CELES"
msgid ""
"Adaptation is the key, yes? For now we must each find\n"
"a way to enjoy our current situation."
msgstr ""

#. アホが、言ってろ…
msgctxt "0020 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "Whatever you say, ya fuckin' loon..."
msgstr ""

#. とりあえず、今後も調査を続け、
#. 何か新しい発見があれば、随時報告するという事で…
msgctxt "0021 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"For now, let's just continue our investigation, and\n"
"let everyone know if you should discover something."
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、今日はもう解散？
msgctxt "0022 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "So, are we done for today?"
msgstr ""

#. あぁ…そうだな…
msgctxt "0023 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "W-Well...yeah, I guess so."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>なんだか…一気に重い空気になったな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0024 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The air seemed to suddenly grow heavy again.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>期待させといて裏切る…
#. これが黒幕のやり方なのか…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0025 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Was this the mastermind's plan? To give us hope, just\n"
"to turn around and betray that hope...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0026 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."
